r_map ([0:({2,0,"Koff",80,"ranks","{Player}","Fri Nov 15 13:31:08 2002","Okies, I start planning those demonexp ranks. And maybe also those guild/skill ranks.Demonexp ranks is shown on finger too? Anyway, so far Í got those rank limits, all you have to do isaccept that those are OK.Rank chances after these points of demonexp: 5M/10M/20M/50M/100M/200M/500M/900M/1GSounds ok?---> Back to the planning",}),1:({0,0,"Cathoris",1,"typo","[Player]","Sat Nov 16 01:15:17 2002","*grin*  Bulletin board :)",}),2:({0,1,"Cathoris",1,"typo","[Player]","Sat Nov 16 01:21:27 2002","no topic for this so I'll stick it here.Despite having broadcast on warlock, \"warlock last\" returned 0",}),3:({0,2,"Cathoris",1,"typo","[Player]","Sat Nov 16 01:22:45 2002","sacrifice w/o argument gives \"SAcrifice what?\"  double caps.",}),4:({0,3,"Cathoris",1,"typo","[Player]","Sat Nov 16 01:23:25 2002","sorry for so many. forgot last sentence in room desc has \"Front of that statue\" instead of \"In front of...\"",}),5:({4,0,"Koff",80,"skillnames","[Player]","Sun Nov 17 04:49:53 2002","I already have those new skill names, all you have to do is accept them :)",}),6:({5,0,"Koff",80,"More messages to chaos-strike","[Player]","Sun Nov 17 04:51:55 2002","Well, if Siki allows me, I can come up with some new chaos strike (let see if that name changes!) messages, but i'll doubt it if they'll be as _dramatic_ as your example was. We'll see....",}),7:({0,4,"Cremater",4,"typo","[Player]","Wed Nov 20 21:57:17 2002","The man says: 'Currently iam seeking a 'Corpse of Guard'. I am willing to reward you if you bring me one of those corpse.The last word should be in plural, too.Also: The man says: 'I Might have couple of tasks for you'Should be: _a_ couple of tasks ",}),8:({0,5,"Cremater",12,"typo","[Player]","Thu Nov 21 00:04:10 2002","The plaque room desc: 1st sentence: acidid -> acidic, 3rd sentence: a iron -> an iron, i'd suggest changing carved on -> carved in and finally i'd put a , (mika pilkku on englanniks!?!) after the first \"it\". 4th sentence: propably -> probably. 5th sentence: blades hangs -> blades hang. Last sentence: this migh make a bit more sense if it were: The chandelier has a couple of burning torches in place.",}),9:({0,6,"Razarac",91,"typo","{Player}","Wed Dec 11 22:10:52 2002","Skill remove purity says that its skill name is soul channeling",}),10:({0,7,"Razarac",91,"typo","{Player}","Wed Dec 11 22:12:28 2002","Looking at statue in board room says:The status is made from black ....Status should be statue ,)",}),11:({0,8,"Merak",65,"typo","{Player}","Sun May 18 03:44:04 2003","Lesser Scavenger Demon descThe scavengeris walking on four legs that are twisted and bloody.It looks like this demon isn't the smartest of demons.It has poor fighting abilities / I has a poor fighting ability and ...",}),12:({0,9,"Nightfire",3,"typo","[Player]","Tue Jul  8 04:34:50 2003","in the room with the old man, there're a few typos at the end of the desc. there's a \"its is sayed\" when it should be \"it is said\"..",}),13:({0,10,"Nightfire",4,"typo","[Player]","Tue Jul  8 04:44:18 2003","another typo. in the desc of the statue in the room east of the first school, it says, something...",}),14:({0,11,"Nightfire",4,"typo","[Player]","Tue Jul  8 04:44:56 2003","ok, that was embarassing. it says prepresenting, instead of representing",}),])
